# 统一行尾：文本内容在仓库中规范化为 LF，检出到工作区也使用 LF
# （Windows 上不再自动转 CRLF，避免 “LF will be replaced by CRLF” 噪音）。
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf

# Windows 批处理脚本保持 CRLF。
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件不做文本/行尾转换。
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.so binary
*.dylib binary
*.pyc binary
